{"seq":3,"slug":"termination-dispute-network-performance-audit","title":"终止、争议解决与网络绩效审计：违约认定与退出机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-franchise-dealer-network-expansion/disclosure-royalty-control/termination-dispute-network-performance-audit","wordCount":3094,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"终止-争议解决与网络绩效审计-违约认定与退出机制\">终止、争议解决与网络绩效审计：违约认定与退出机制</h1><p>一份海外经销或特许经营合同签下去，真正的考验在两年后的某一天：经销商连续三个季度达不到最低采购量、把货串到了邻国、或者开始拖欠特许权使用费。这时出口商面临一串问题——他算不算&quot;违约&quot;？是轻微还是根本违约？要不要先给治愈期才能终止？对方索赔时，去哪个国家、按哪国法律、走仲裁还是诉讼？而这之前，你是否有能拿出证据的绩效审计台账？<strong>审计提供事实，违约认定把事实翻译成法律后果，争议解决决定后果由谁裁决</strong>——三者缺一，退出就从风险控制变成制造风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>退出机制要解决三个递进的问题：<strong>凭什么退</strong>（违约是否成立、是否根本违约）、<strong>怎么退</strong>（终止通知、终止后义务清单）、<strong>谁来裁</strong>（争议解决条款）。它依赖两条事实生产线——网络绩效审计与特许权使用费审计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[绩效审计 + Royalty 审计] --&gt;|生产事实与证据| B[违约认定&lt;br/&gt;轻微/重大/根本/预期]&#10;  B --&gt;|守约方主张| C[终止通知 + 治愈期]&#10;  C --&gt; D[争议解决条款&lt;br/&gt;协商→调解→仲裁]&#10;  D --&gt; E[裁决 / 和解 + 终止后义务执行]&#10;  E --&gt;|反哺条款设计| A\">graph TD\n  A[绩效审计 + Royalty 审计] --&gt;|生产事实与证据| B[违约认定&lt;br/&gt;轻微/重大/根本/预期]\n  B --&gt;|守约方主张| C[终止通知 + 治愈期]\n  C --&gt; D[争议解决条款&lt;br/&gt;协商→调解→仲裁]\n  D --&gt; E[裁决 / 和解 + 终止后义务执行]\n  E --&gt;|反哺条款设计| A</pre><p><strong>审计的深度决定了终止的底气</strong>——没有合同明示的审计权与留存证据，违约认定就只剩口头描述，进入仲裁后缺乏证据的一方几乎必然败诉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"违约的梯度认定与终止权行使\">违约的梯度认定与终止权行使</h2><p>把&quot;违约&quot;当成一个开关是退出失控的第一大源头。合同里几乎不存在&quot;一违约即可终止&quot;，存在的是一条<strong>梯度</strong>：不同严重程度对应不同的通知、治愈与救济路径。</p>\n<p><strong>最底层的法定框架</strong>分属两大法系。普通法传统区分 <strong>条件条款（condition）</strong>、<strong>保证条款（warranty）</strong> 与 <strong>中间条款（innominate term）</strong>：只有违反条件条款才当然赋予终止权。大陆法系与国际公约则用 <strong>根本违约（fundamental breach）</strong> 概念——CISG（《联合国国际货物销售合同公约》，1980）第 25 条将其定义为&quot;实质剥夺对方依合同有权期待的利益&quot;的违约，第 49 条据此赋予宣告合同无效的权利；中国《民法典》第 563 条规定法定解除权。</p>\n<p><strong>中间层是合同自己写的治愈期（cure period）</strong>。成熟合同通常规定：非根本违约，守约方须书面通知，违约方在 <strong>15–30 天</strong>内治愈；逾期未治愈，守约方才取得终止权。跳过治愈期直接终止，即便违约成立，也可能被认定为<strong>不当终止（wrongful termination）</strong>。下表归纳四档违约的治愈期与救济。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>违约等级</th>\n<th>典型情形</th>\n<th>治愈期</th>\n<th>守约方救济</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>迟交月度报表、逾期数日付款、单次陈列不达标</td>\n<td>15–30 天</td>\n<td>催告 + 违约金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重大</td>\n<td>持续不达最低采购量、跨区销售、擅改价格体系</td>\n<td>30 天（可累计）</td>\n<td>治愈期后终止 + 索赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根本</td>\n<td>长期不付款、侵权假冒、转授未经授权主体</td>\n<td>无（即时终止）</td>\n<td>立即终止 + 全额索赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预期</td>\n<td>明确表示将不履行、转移资产</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>可提前终止 + 加速到期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>累计触发条款</strong>是梯度设计里最实用的机制：约定&quot;同一违约情形在 12 个月内发生三次，第三次视为重大违约&quot;。这解决了出口商的真实困境——经销商每次踩线一点点，单独看都不足以终止，累积起来却足以摧毁渠道。</p>\n<p>终止权的行使是<strong>要式行为</strong>，程序瑕疵会让实体权利归零。通知需包含引用的违约条款、事实陈述（时间、行为、证据编号）、已给予的治愈期、终止生效日与结算安排，并送达约定地址。终止<strong>类型</strong>决定责任天平：<strong>有因终止</strong>可索赔损失；<strong>无因终止</strong>（提前 90–180 天通知）虽保留退出阀门，但许多法域会限制或要求补偿；<strong>自动终止</strong>（破产、丧失执照、实控人变更）几乎不需治愈期，是风控硬闸。</p>\n<p><strong>不当终止的代价</strong>须提前算清。赔偿以<strong>期待利益</strong>为基准，CISG 第 74–77 条要求可预见并课以守约方<strong>减损义务</strong>。关键分野在欧盟：<strong>商业代理</strong> 依《商业代理指令》(86/653/EEC) 第 17 条可主张<strong>商誉补偿</strong>，上限约为年均佣金的<strong>一年</strong>；<strong>分销商</strong> 原则不享有该补偿。把关系写成 &quot;agent&quot; 还是 &quot;distributor&quot;，直接决定终止时的补偿敞口。此外多数法域要求行使终止权遵循<strong>诚信原则</strong>（CISG 第 7 条），长期默许违约后再突然终止可能因<strong>禁反言</strong>被挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"终止后义务-退出机制的清单化\">终止后义务：退出机制的清单化</h2><p>终止不是终点，而是一批新义务的起点。这些义务若未写清，退出会变成一场扯皮。下表覆盖六类常见终止后义务：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>义务类别</th>\n<th>具体事项</th>\n<th>期限</th>\n<th>风险点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IP 去标识化</td>\n<td>拆除商标、门头、物料、域名更名</td>\n<td>15–30 天</td>\n<td>逾期使用即侵权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存处置</td>\n<td>买回、限期售清或销毁证明</td>\n<td>60–180 天</td>\n<td>未约定买回则对方抛售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞业限制</td>\n<td>期限内不得代理竞争品牌</td>\n<td>6–24 个月</td>\n<td>过宽易被判无效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户与数据</td>\n<td>客户名单归属、数据删除与移交</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n<td>涉及 GDPR 等合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>款项结算</td>\n<td>欠付货款、特许权使用费、尾佣</td>\n<td>立即/30 天</td>\n<td>常与库存买回对抵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手册与机密</td>\n<td>归还手册、停止使用机密信息</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>需保留审计追索权</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>去标识化（de-branding）</strong> 最容易翻车：经销商终止后往往已无动力配合，若合同未约定&quot;逾期未拆除视为每日违约金 X 美元&quot;的<strong>约定违约金（liquidated damages）</strong>，出口商只能另行诉讼。竞业限制的边界也要小心——欧盟《纵向协议集体豁免条例》(VBER，第 2022/720 号条例，2022 年 6 月 1 日生效) 规定：<strong>经销</strong>场景下采购方的非竞争义务原则上不得超过 <strong>5 年</strong>，超过则不再自动豁免；地域范围应与其原授权区域挂钩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"争议解决的分层设计\">争议解决的分层设计</h2><p>争议解决条款是整份合同里<strong>最不该套模板</strong>的部分，须写明四件事：<strong>适用法律</strong>、<strong>争议解决方式</strong>、<strong>仲裁机构与仲裁地（seat）</strong>、<strong>语言与仲裁员人数</strong>。现代合同普遍采用<strong>分层争议解决（escalation clause）</strong>：业务层协商 15–30 天 → 调解 → 仲裁或诉讼，把大量争议消化在成本最低的层级。</p>\n<p><strong>仲裁优先于诉讼</strong>的理由很实际：1958 年《承认及执行外国仲裁裁决公约》（纽约公约）有 <strong>170 多个缔约国</strong>，仲裁裁决的跨境执行远比外国法院判决顺畅。主流机构包括 ICC（2021 版规则）、LCIA、SIAC、HKIAC、CIETAC。<strong>仲裁地（seat）</strong> 决定裁决国籍与撤销管辖法院，&quot;在新加坡仲裁&quot;不等于&quot;在新加坡开庭&quot;。2019 年《新加坡调解公约》（2020 年 9 月 12 日生效）为调解结案提供跨境执行依据。条款还须保留<strong>紧急保全</strong>与<strong>费用分担</strong>约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络绩效审计与特许权使用费审计\">网络绩效审计与特许权使用费审计</h2><p>审计的第一原则是<strong>审计对象是经销商的交付结果，而非其内部经营自由</strong>。出口商只能在合同明示授权内查账，因此合同须写入<strong>审计权（right to audit）</strong> 条款：记录范围、频率（每年一次 + &quot;合理怀疑&quot;时的临时审计）、提前通知期（15–30 天）、费用承担（重大偏差时由经销商承担）、追溯期（2–3 年）。</p>\n<p>网络绩效审计分<strong>结果指标</strong>与<strong>合规指标</strong>两层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>指标示例</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>判定用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采购履约</td>\n<td>实际采购额 vs 最低采购量（MOP）</td>\n<td>订单/发票</td>\n<td>是否触发重大违约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实销售</td>\n<td>售出率、终端动销</td>\n<td>POS / Sell-out 报表</td>\n<td>识别&quot;库存型经销商&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存健康</td>\n<td>库存周转天数 DOS</td>\n<td>进销存台账</td>\n<td>库存积压 / 抛货预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格合规</td>\n<td>零售价偏离建议价幅度</td>\n<td>巡店 / 电商抓取</td>\n<td>破价/扰乱价格体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域合规</td>\n<td>跨区销售的货值占比</td>\n<td>批号/序列号追溯</td>\n<td>串货认定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌合规</td>\n<td>陈列、话术、售后标准</td>\n<td>神秘顾客 / 巡检</td>\n<td>治愈期触发依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>售出率与库存周转</strong>最能揭穿渠道虚胖：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>售出率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>当期 Sell-out（终端动销）</mtext><mtext>当期 Sell-in（进货）</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>DOS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>期初库存</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>期末库存</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>日均 Sell-out</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{售出率} = \\frac{\\text{当期 Sell-out（终端动销）}}{\\text{当期 Sell-in（进货）}}, \\qquad \\text{DOS} = \\frac{\\text{期初库存} + \\text{期末库存}}{2 \\times \\text{日均 Sell-out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">售出率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期</span><span class=\"mord\"> Sell-in</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（进货）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期</span><span class=\"mord\"> Sell-out</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（终端动销）</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日均</span><span class=\"mord\"> Sell-out</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初库存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期末库存</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>健康网络售出率通常在 <strong>0.85–1.15</strong> 波动；长期低于 0.7 意味货压在渠道而非被消费者买走，是最典型的&quot;囤货换返利&quot;；DOS 超过约定的 <strong>90 天</strong>上限则说明市场判断已偏离。<strong>神秘顾客（mystery shopping）</strong> 与巡检采集合规指标，可参照 ISO 19011:2018《管理体系审核指南》（独立性、基于证据、风险导向）设计——审查员不应是被审查区域的销售人员。抽查的<strong>批号/序列号追溯</strong>是串货认定的黄金证据。</p>\n<p><strong>特许权使用费审计</strong>与绩效审计同源但目的不同：看<strong>是否如实申报</strong>。它依赖一条标准机制——经销商按周期提交<strong>销售报表（royalty report）</strong>，声明净销售额与应缴费用，并保留原始记录。申报基数须用公式定义清楚，最易被做小的正是&quot;净销售额&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净销售额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>开票总额</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>退货</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>经批准的折扣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>已缴税费</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净销售额} = \\text{开票总额} - \\text{退货} - \\text{经批准的折扣} - \\text{已缴税费}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净销售额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开票总额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退货</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">经批准的折扣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已缴税费</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把&quot;运费&quot;&quot;市场推广费&quot;&quot;返利&quot;塞进扣减项是常见手法；合同应逐项列明可扣减与不可扣减项目。发现少报后的追偿含本金、利息与审计费：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>365</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>audit</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>audited</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>reported</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\Delta B \\times r + \\Delta B \\times r \\times i \\times \\frac{t}{365} + C_{\\text{audit}}, \\quad \\Delta B = B_{\\text{audited}} - B_{\\text{reported}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">audit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">audited</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reported</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为费率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 为逾期年化利率（可参照 SOFR、EURIBOR 或中国 LPR 加基点）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为逾期天数。合同通常再加一条：少报比例超过阈值（如 <strong>3%–5%</strong>）时，除补缴外还应承担审计费与违约金。执行层面还需三件配套工具：<strong>查看原始凭证权</strong>、<strong>实地审计权</strong>、<strong>逾期提交报表的推定条款</strong>（如&quot;逾期 30 天未提交，按上期金额的 120% 计费&quot;）——缺了它，经销商只需拖延提交即可无限期滞缴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>违约是<strong>梯度</strong>而非开关：轻微/重大/根本/预期四档对应不同治愈期与救济，<strong>累计触发条款</strong>是应对边际违约的关键设计。</li>\n<li>终止是要式行为，通知的条款引用、事实与证据编号、送达方式缺一不可；欧盟 <strong>86/653/EEC 第 17 条</strong>让&quot;代理&quot;与&quot;经销&quot;在商誉补偿上产生实质分野。</li>\n<li>终止后义务需清单化：去标识化、库存买回、竞业限制（受 <strong>VBER 2022/720</strong> 限制，经销的非竞争义务原则不超 5 年）、数据与款项结算。</li>\n<li>争议解决应<strong>分层</strong>：协商 → 调解（可依《新加坡调解公约》执行）→ 仲裁（依 1958 年《纽约公约》跨境执行），并写明仲裁地与紧急保全保留。</li>\n<li>绩效审计要把&quot;感觉不行&quot;翻译成证据：<strong>售出率</strong>与 <strong>DOS</strong> 揭穿渠道虚胖，<strong>序列号追溯</strong>锁定串货；特许权使用费追偿为 <strong>本金 + 利息 + 审计费</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可复用的心智模型：<strong>审计生产事实，违约认定把事实翻译成法律后果，争议解决条款决定后果由谁裁决</strong>。任何一环缺位，退出就不再是风险控制，而是把风险从对方身上搬到自己身上。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>上游承接：退出机制的前提是入驻时就把审计权、终止条款与送达地址写进合同（见 <a href=\"../partner-onboarding-enablement/dealer-onboarding-activation-checklist\">经销商入驻与激活清单</a>）；串货认定的边界取决于当初如何划定<a href=\"../market-prioritization-territory/territory-exclusivity-carve-out\">区域独家与除外情形</a>；渠道模式的定性直接决定终止时的补偿敞口，见<a href=\"../channel-model-legal-entity/franchise-vs-distributor-agent-model\">三种渠道模式的差异模型</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"终止、争议解决与网络绩效审计：违约认定与退出机制","id":"终止-争议解决与网络绩效审计-违约认定与退出机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"违约的梯度认定与终止权行使","id":"违约的梯度认定与终止权行使"},{"level":2,"text":"终止后义务：退出机制的清单化","id":"终止后义务-退出机制的清单化"},{"level":2,"text":"争议解决的分层设计","id":"争议解决的分层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"网络绩效审计与特许权使用费审计","id":"网络绩效审计与特许权使用费审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特许权使用费的转让定价、预提税与跨境汇出路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-franchise-dealer-network-expansion/disclosure-royalty-control/royalty-transfer-pricing-remittance"},"next":null}